# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0000062> (experienced in)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0000062> "Brain freeze is a brief, intense pain experienced in the forehead.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0000062> "A relation between a nervous system process and a cognitive process in which a physical sensation is subjectively experienced as occurring in an anatomical entity, site, or a site where an anatomical entity is usually located.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0000062> <http://orcid.org/0000-0001-9625-1899>)
