AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0000053> "Acute pain is caused by injury, surgery, illness, trauma, or painful medical procedures and generally lasts from a few minutes to less than six months. Acute pain usually disappears whenever the underlying cause is treated or healed.")
