AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010247> "Trigeminal neuralgia caused by contact between the affected trigeminal nerve and a space-occupying lesion.")
