AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010250> "Idiopathic trigeminal neuralgia with recurrent paroxysms of unilateral facial pain that is concomitant continuous of near-continuous pain between attacks in the affected trigeminal distirbution.")
