# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010264> (paroxysmal hemifacial pain)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010264> "Attacks of severe, strictly hemifacial pain, without head pain, lasting 2–30 minutes and occurring several or many times a day. The attacks may be associated with ipsilateral conjunctival injection, lacrimation, nasal congestion, rhinorrhoea, forehead and facial sweating, miosis, ptosis and/or eyelid oedema.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010264> "PMID:32103673")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010264> <https://orcid.org/0009-0003-5583-4731>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010264> "2025-07-07T17:18:22Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010264> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010296>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010264> "ICOP number: 5.3.2")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010264> "paroxysmal hemifacial pain"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010264> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010260>)

