# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010268> (short-lasting unilateral neuralgiform facial pain attacks with cranial autonomic symptoms (SUNFA))

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010268> "Attacks of moderate or severe, strictly unilateral oral and/or facial pain, without head pain, lasting seconds to minutes, occurring at least once a day and usually associated with prominent lacrimation and redness of the ipsilateral eye and/or other local autonomic symptoms and/or signs.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010268> "PMID:32103673")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010268> <https://orcid.org/0009-0003-5583-4731>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010268> "2025-07-07T17:23:06Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010268> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010296>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010268> "ICOP number: 5.3.3")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010268> "short-lasting unilateral neuralgiform facial pain attacks with cranial autonomic symptoms (SUNFA)"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010268> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010260>)

